  "solution": "Given :\n\n15 - (-5) × {4 - (7 - 3)} ÷ [3 × {5 + (-3) × (-6)}]\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/833bf95aed1ad9b2103d937814ed938d64f5ca098f7062f9d7bf16f1d7d38879.png] \n\nCalculation :\n\n15 - (-5) × {4 - (7 - 3)} ÷ [3 × {5 + (-3) × (-6)}]\n\n⇒ 15 - (-5) × {0} ÷ [3 × {5 + 18}]\n\n⇒ 15 + 5 × 0 × 1/69\n\n⇒15 + 0 = 15\n\n∴ The answer is 15",
